      "notes": "<h2>WELCOME TO THE AI INFLUENCER PORTFOLIO</h2>\n<p>First off, let me begin by giving you a <strong>massive welcome</strong>. It’s not just about starting another course - this is about embracing a system that’s crafted to completely transform how you approach earning with AI and low-ticket offers.</p>\n<p>Throughout this course, you'll not only be learning but also harnessing tools and methods that have already been tested and proven. You're stepping into a world where the fluff, the jargon, and the typical headaches are all stripped away. What’s left? <strong>The fastest route</strong> from zero to making money with AI.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>WHAT YOU’LL GET OUT OF THIS COURSE 🚀</h2>\n<p>This isn’t just a course - it’s your access point to a new way of thinking and working. Here’s what you’re walking into:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><p><strong>Create Your Own \"Air Influencer\":</strong> You’ll learn how to build a system where you don’t need to handle customer service, tech headaches, or any operational chaos. It’s all done for you.</p></li>\n  <li><p><strong>Selecting the Perfect Offer:</strong> I'll guide you to an optimized offer that aligns with this system. Everything is streamlined for efficiency and profitability.</p></li>\n  <li><p><strong>Zero to Profitability, Fast:</strong> Forget wasting time on outdated methods. This system is designed to cut through noise and get you earning fast.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>As part of this course, we’ve created your very own AI influencer. This AI influencer will be delivered to you within 24 hours, so you’ve got more than enough time to go through the course and start getting everything ready. Of course, you can create your own as well, and I’ll show you how to do that. Your AI influencer can be found on the left-hand sidebar and is usually delivered a lot faster than most - in 24 hours. You’ll be notified on this portal and by email once it’s completed.</p>\n<blockquote><p>⚡ <strong>This is the exact method that has made us over $50,000 in a single day.</strong> You're getting everything - no gatekeeping, no holding back.</p></blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>WHY THIS COURSE IS DIFFERENT ✨</h2>\n<p>Beyond the strategies and insights, this course provides you with <strong>operating systems</strong> that will supercharge your progress. These aren’t theoretical concepts - these are the same inbuilt AI tools and systems that we personally use daily.</p>\n<p>Whether it’s for writing copy, creating content, or streamlining your workflows, you’ll have access to <strong>tools that make life easier and progress faster</strong>. Think of these as your secret weapon for scaling efficiently.</p>\n<blockquote><p>🎯 <strong>No guesswork. No barriers. Just speed and results.</strong> These operating systems are here to make sure you operate at peak performance.</p></blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>REMEMBER TO WATCH THIS INTRO 👀</h2>\n<p>Before diving into the core lessons, it’s essential you watch this full intro. Why? Because it lays out the foundation for <strong>everything we’re going to achieve together</strong>.</p>\n<p>This is more than just passive learning - this is about implementing a system that works. So, get ready, get focused, and let’s unlock this journey to success.</p>",
