      "notes": "<h2>GETTING SUPPORT</h2>\n\n<p>We’ve designed our <strong>support system</strong> to ensure you get assistance whenever you need it. Whether it’s advice, tech help, or anything related to this masterclass, we've got you covered.</p>\n\n<h3>One-On-One Support</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>Our dedicated support team responds to queries within about <strong>12 hours.</strong></li>\n  <li>Perfect for situations where you need personalized help or a human touch.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>AI Support</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>Get <strong>instant answers</strong> with our AI-powered support tool.</li>\n  <li>Fully trained on every aspect of this masterclass and our operating systems.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<blockquote>💡 <strong>Key Insight:</strong> Whether you reach out to a human or use the AI tool, we are here to ensure your journey with this program is seamless.</blockquote>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>Whenever you need help, don’t hesitate to ask. We’re committed to helping you succeed in this masterclass and beyond!</p>",
