      "notes": "<h2>TOOL STACK 💻</h2><p>When it comes to building our online AI-driven business, we deliberately keep things simple by using only <em>essential tools</em>. It can be tempting to pile up subscriptions for every new app or service, but that's not how we operate. Less is often more.</p><p>Below is the <strong>core tool stack</strong> we use to run and scale this business effectively:</p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-[#C9A44C] underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#C9A44C]/80\" href=\"https://www.gohighlevel.com/?fp_ref=justfunnel\"><strong>GoHighLevel</strong> </a>- This is the backbone of our business. It powers our sales pages, email marketing, and many other elements crucial for generating revenue. Without GoHighLevel, we simply couldn’t make money with this business model. You can get a <strong>FREE 14-day trial</strong> if you sign up under our link.</p></li></ul><img class=\"rounded-lg max-w-full\" src=\"/api/portal/images/4c83f3fd-aa10-4b66-9e79-98e5eb03c50a.png\"><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-[#C9A44C] underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#C9A44C]/80\" href=\"https://higgsfield.ai/\"><strong>Higgsfield AI</strong> </a>- This tool is responsible for creating the visual side of our AI, including images, artwork, and even motion graphics. It’s an integral part of how we bring our AI creations to life.</p></li></ul><img class=\"rounded-lg max-w-full\" src=\"/api/portal/images/ce27181f-31be-46b7-b742-86d952036e44.png\"><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-[#C9A44C] underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#C9A44C]/80\" href=\"https://www.heygen.com/?sid=rewardful&amp;utm_content=creator&amp;utm_medium=affiliate&amp;via=gregory-cooke\"><strong>HeyGen</strong></a> - Used for video creation. This tool allows us to craft high-quality videos using our AI, making it essential for delivering engaging content.</p></li></ul><img class=\"rounded-lg max-w-full\" src=\"/api/portal/images/8e599865-67a6-4e2e-b35d-9abd1c4606ad.png\"><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-[#C9A44C] underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#C9A44C]/80\" href=\"https://elevenlabs.io/\"><strong>Eleven Labs</strong></a> - This powerful tool focuses on generating AI voices, giving a distinct personality and sound to our creations. It’s a must-have for voice generation and audio production.</p></li></ul><img class=\"rounded-lg max-w-full\" src=\"/api/portal/images/5873604e-0730-4503-9171-1411d249e94d.png\"><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-[#C9A44C] underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#C9A44C]/80\" href=\"https://manychat.partnerlinks.io/qnp38na8qz93\"><strong>ManyChat</strong></a> - This powerful tool focuses on generating AI voices, giving a distinct personality and sound to our creations. It’s a must-have for voice generation and audio production.</p></li></ul><img class=\"rounded-lg max-w-full\" src=\"/api/portal/images/c48fb9a0-6fc7-4ae9-a409-ec4039fb3346.png\"><blockquote><p>📌 <em>Key Insight</em>: Start with these four tools to build your foundation. Other recommendations may follow later, but these are non-negotiable for the AI business model.</p></blockquote><p>As we progress through the course, I’ll highlight additional tools that might be helpful, but remember - the goal is to <em>simplify</em>. Stick to what you <em>really need</em> and only expand as your needs grow.</p>",
