      "action_task": null,
      "notes": "<h2>GET A PRE-MADE INFLUENCER OR ATTEND A LIVE EVENT</h2>\n\n<p>This masterclass is really just the beginning. If you’re looking for more support or opportunities to scale your influence and business, we offer two powerful options to help you level up.</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h3>🎤 OPTION 1: ATTEND A LIVE EVENT</h3>\n\n<p><strong>Live events</strong> are an immersive experience designed to get you results faster than any other method. Over three transformative days, we work side-by-side with you to build out your systems and overcome any obstacles that might be holding you back.</p>\n\n<p>Not only will you receive hands-on guidance from me and the team, but you’ll also gain a major <strong>mindset shift</strong>. Being in the same room, with no distractions, creates an energy you simply won’t find anywhere else.</p>\n\n<p>Here’s what you’ll experience:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Private VIP dinners with like-minded individuals</li>\n  <li>Exclusive strategies that aren’t taught in this masterclass</li>\n  <li>Access to high-performance coaches</li>\n</ul>\n\n<blockquote>⚡ <strong>Key Takeaway:</strong> These events are hosted worldwide. Check the link below to view upcoming dates, apply for the next event, or choose the location that suits you best!</blockquote>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h3>🤖 OPTION 2: GET A PRE-BUILT AI INFLUENCER BUSINESS</h3>\n\n<p>If you want a head start, consider our <strong>pre-built AI influencer businesses</strong>. These are ready-to-go packages that include:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Pre-built social media profiles</li>\n  <li>Established audiences and followers</li>\n  <li>Content planned for the next 90 days</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>This option is perfect if you’re looking to save time and hit the ground running. You can even discuss your specific needs with our team to ensure you get the best fit for your goals.</p>\n\n<blockquote>🎯 <strong>Pro Tip:</strong> A pre-built AI influencer business gives you a massive jumpstart, helping you skip the grind of building an audience and creating initial content from scratch.</blockquote>",
