      "notes": "<h2>🔴 WHAT: SELECTING YOUR OFFER</h2><p>In this lesson, you'll be selecting the offer you want to promote. This is a <strong>critical step</strong> because your offer becomes the foundation for all your content. Choosing the right offer will ensure your efforts result in smoother sales and better outcomes, while the wrong choice can make things unnecessarily difficult.</p><h3>CRITERIA FOR SELECTING AN OFFER</h3><ul><li><p><strong>70%+ Payout on Front-End Offer:</strong> The vendor pays out at least 70% of the revenue on each sale to you.</p></li><li><p><strong>High-Ticket Back-End Offer ($500+):</strong> The product should have additional high-ticket offers on the back end, ideally over $1,000, so you can earn more from post-purchase upgrades.</p></li></ul><hr><h2>🟠 WHY: UNDERSTANDING YOUR OPTIONS</h2><p><strong>NOTE:</strong> My whole goal for you here is to make money as FAST as possible with AI. Therefore most people will choose option 1 as we handle all tech, customer service and sales for you but no obligation. Option 2 and 3 are there for you also.</p><h3>OPTION 1: USING OUR OWN PRODUCTS</h3><p>As a partner, you have access to a ready-made suite of products and services that meet the above criteria. Here's why it's a great choice:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Front-End Offer:</strong> Our AI Influencer Masterclass has an average order value of $170, and you'll earn 70% of that (around $119 per sale).</p></li><li><p><strong>Back-End Offer:</strong> High-ticket offers include live events ($1,000 commission per ticket) and pre-made AI Influencer businesses ($500 commission per sale).</p></li><li><p><strong>Ease of Promotion:</strong> We handle all customer service, tech, remarketing, and sales for you. You just have to send traffic to the link.</p></li></ul><img class=\"rounded-lg max-w-full\" src=\"/api/portal/images/b9de31eb-0bf3-4b4d-b5cf-e9766844475e.png\"><blockquote><p>💡 <strong>Tip:</strong> You can find your affiliate links in the left-hand sidebar of your portal. These links are already set up and ready to use!</p></blockquote><h3>OPTION 2: PROMOTING OFFERS FROM CLICKBANK OR DIGISTORE</h3><p>Not interested in using our own products? No problem. Platforms like <strong>Clickbank</strong> and <strong>Digistore</strong> allow you to promote other offers in popular niches like health, wealth, and relationships.</p><ol><li><p>Create an account on Clickbank or Digistore and complete the verification process.</p></li><li><p>Search for a <strong>front-end product</strong> (small entry price, big market demand).</p></li><li><p>Select a <strong>high-ticket back-end product</strong> (ideally earning $500+ per sale).</p></li></ol><blockquote><p>📌 <strong>Note:</strong> A list of popular offers and recommended products is available at the bottom of the resources section in your course portal.</p></blockquote><p></p><img class=\"rounded-lg max-w-full\" src=\"/api/portal/images/46ae532c-142d-4e18-b31b-7d9280a187b1.png\"><p></p><h3>OPTION 3: SELLING YOUR OWN DIGITAL PRODUCT</h3><p>If you're ready to take a larger piece of the pie, you can create and sell your own digital product. Here’s how:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Leverage Pre-Made Products:</strong> If you're part of the Platinum Club, you can access 47 pre-made digital products that you can sell as your own with just one click.</p></li><li><p><strong>Create Your Own High-Ticket Back-End:</strong> Pair your lower-ticket product with your custom high-ticket offer or use an affiliate program like Clickbank to find a matching back-end product.</p></li><li><p><strong>100% Revenue Share:</strong> Selling your own product allows you to keep 100% of the revenue from front-end sales.</p></li></ul><blockquote><p>⚙️ <strong>Pro Tip:</strong> With the pre-made products in Platinum Club or 47 Digital Product Portfolio, you can avoid the hassle of creating content from scratch. They’re designed for quick setup and instant sales.</p></blockquote><hr><h2>🟢 HOW: CHOOSING THE RIGHT NICHE</h2><p>Selecting the right niche is crucial. Here are some niches to consider based on popularity and earning potential:</p><h3>STEP 1: SELECT NICHE</h3><ul><li><p><strong>AI:</strong> One of the fastest-growing niches with massive demand and evergreen potential.</p></li><li><p><strong>Weight Loss:</strong> Always in demand, particularly in Western countries. Compliance may require extra care, but it’s a lucrative category.</p></li><li><p><strong>Finance &amp; Wealth:</strong> Easy to sell high-ticket offers in this space. People are always looking to make or manage money better.</p></li><li><p><strong>Relationships:</strong> Good for front-end products, but high-ticket offers can be more difficult to sell.</p></li><li><p><strong>Biohacking:</strong> Trending niche with unique appeal, though high-ticket conversions might be more challenging.</p></li></ul><blockquote><p>👀 <strong>Resource:</strong> Check the \"Popular Offers\" list in your course portal for a curated list of trending niches and products you can start promoting today.</p></blockquote><h3>STEP 2: CHOOSE YOUR OFFER</h3><p>Once you've selected your niche, the next step is to choose the offer you want to promote. There are three main routes you can take:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Using Our Own Products:</strong> If you’re promoting our own products, your next step is simple. Select which offer you want to promote from the options listed in this course portal and proceed directly to the next lesson.</p></li><li><p><strong>Clickbank or Digistore Affiliate Offers:</strong> If you’re opting for external platforms like Clickbank or Digistore, sign up for those platforms, complete verification, and browse their marketplaces to select the offer you want to sell.</p></li><li><p><strong>Your Own Digital Product:</strong> If you’re selling your own digital product, you can build a sales page on GoHighLevel. A template is provided further down in this course, and a bonus section will cover its setup in detail.</p></li></ul><p>For Platinum Club members using our pre-made digital products, this step is even faster. Simply select your product from the available 47 options and perform a one-click install. A demo video is available in the portal to guide you through the process.</p><blockquote><p>💭 <strong>Tip:</strong> Opting for our own products or pre-made digital products streamlines the process significantly, saving time so you can focus on generating content.</p></blockquote><h3>STEP 3: EXECUTE YOUR PLATFORM SETUP</h3><p>Depending on the offer type you've selected, proceed as follows:</p><ul><li><p>If you’re using Clickbank or Digistore, complete your account setup and verification process. Explore their marketplaces thoroughly to pinpoint the offer that aligns best with your niche, audience, and goals.</p></li><li><p>If you’re selling your own digital product, refer to the bonus section at the end of this course for tips on building sales pages using GoHighLevel.</p></li><li><p>If you're using our pre-made digital products, follow the demo video in the portal to perform the one-click install process and start promoting immediately.</p></li></ul><p>Once this step is done, you’re ready to move forward with content creation and promotion.</p><blockquote><p>📌 <strong>Note:</strong> Selling your own digital product setup guidance is covered in a bonus section at the end of the course. You can revisit it at any time.</p></blockquote><hr><h3>SUMMARY OF THE LESSON</h3><p>To summarise, in this lesson you’ll select your niche, choose your offer, and set up the necessary platform if required. If you’re selling your own custom digital product, additional resources are available at the end of the course.</p><p>Ultimately, our objective is to help you make money as fast as possible with AI by removing hurdles and simplifying the process. All you need to do is create content and let the system do the rest!</p>",
