      "notes": "<h2>🔴 WHAT: COPY FOR YOUR BRIDGE PAGE</h2>\n\n<p>This session focuses on creating the <strong>copy for your bridge page</strong>. The content will include an announcement bar, headline, and call-to-action button text, all designed to guide users effectively toward your offer.</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h2>🟠 WHY: IMPORTANCE OF BRIDGE PAGE COPY</h2>\n\n<p>Your bridge page acts as the crucial connection between your traffic source and the offer you're promoting. <strong>Engaging copy</strong> ensures visitors take action, whether it's clicking your affiliate link or signing up for a service.</p>\n\n<blockquote>💡 <strong>Pro Insight:</strong> Most successful affiliate marketers attribute high conversion rates to well-crafted bridge pages. A strong call-to-action (CTA) can make all the difference.</blockquote>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h2>🟢 HOW: STEP-BY-STEP PROCESS</h2>\n\n<h3>STEP 1: ACCESS THE OS</h3>\n<p>Use our <strong>Operating System (OS)</strong> provided in the adjacent tab. If you're using one of our own products, select the offer directly within the OS. For external offers (e.g., ClickBank or DigiStore), there’s a free-standing text box where you can input the offer details or upload related documents.</p>\n\n<blockquote>⚙️ <strong>Tip:</strong> The more details you provide about the offer, the better the OS will be at generating optimized headlines and CTAs for your page.</blockquote>\n\n<h3>STEP 2: GENERATE THE COPY</h3>\n<ol>\n    <li>Click the <strong>Generate Headline</strong> button inside the OS.</li>\n    <li>It will immediately generate an announcement bar, headline, and CTA button text.</li>\n    <li>Copy the generated text.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<blockquote>🛠️ <strong>Tools You'll Use:</strong> The members portal or external text box for third-party offers like ClickBank or DigiStore.</blockquote>\n\n<h3>STEP 3: IMPLEMENT IN GOHIGHLEVEL</h3>\n<p>Open the <strong>GoHighLevel template</strong> you set up in the previous lesson. Paste the generated copy (announcement bar, headline, and CTA) into the appropriate sections of the template.</p>\n\n<h3>STEP 4: SAVE AND PUBLISH</h3>\n<p>Once the copy has been added to your bridge page template:</p>\n<ol>\n    <li>Click <strong>Save</strong>.</li>\n    <li>Click <strong>Publish</strong>.</li>\n    <li>Ensure the domain is live and functioning.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3>STEP 5: ADD YOUR AFFILIATE LINK</h3>\n<p><strong>Critical Step:</strong> Add your affiliate or partner ID link to the button link on your bridge page. Without this, the traffic from your page cannot be tracked back to you, and you'll miss out on commissions.</p>\n\n<blockquote>📌 <strong>Affiliate Link Locations:</strong></blockquote>\n<ul>\n    <li>For our own products: Find your Unique ID in the <strong>members portal</strong>.</li>\n    <li>For ClickBank offers: Use your <strong>HopID</strong>.</li>\n    <li>For DigiStore offers: Retrieve the product's specific link from your DigiStore dashboard.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<blockquote>🎯 <strong>Key Reminder:</strong> Always double-check that the affiliate button link on your bridge page is accurate before publishing. Small mistakes here can result in lost sales and commissions.</blockquote>",
