      "sort_order": 0,
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "is_published": true,
      "action_task": null,
      "notes": "<h2>INTRO 🌟</h2>\n\n<p>Welcome to this exciting phase of the journey where we dive into creating your very own <strong>AI influencer</strong>. This is one of the cornerstones of the system, and it’s going to be both fun and impactful. Let’s unpack it!</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h3>What’s Already Done for You</h3>\n\n<p>First things first - we’ve already created an AI influencer for you! 🎉 But we’re not stopping there. We’ll guide you step-by-step on how you can create your own whenever you want. Whether it's to expand your arsenal or experiment with more unique personas, you’ll be fully equipped.</p>\n\n<h3>Where to Find Your AI Influencers</h3>\n\n<p>Head over to the <strong>AI Influencers</strong> section located on the left-hand sidebar. Inside, you'll see:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>The AI influencer we’ve pre-built for you</li>\n  <li>The option to add new influencers as needed</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>It’s simple and doesn’t take too long, but it’s crucial to get the execution right!</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h3>Why This Skill Is Critical</h3>\n\n<p>Creating a hyper-realistic influencer is a <strong>game-changer</strong> in this system. If your AI influencer looks fake, people can immediately tell - and the effort becomes pointless. Authenticity is the name of the game here. A realistic persona opens the door to limitless content creation in various scenarios, driving engagement and results.</p>\n\n<blockquote>\n  💡 <strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Keep it simple. Use the tools we recommend and follow the process without overcomplicating things. Simplicity is your ally!\n</blockquote>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h3>Ready to Begin? 🚀</h3>\n\n<p>If you're all set, let’s get started with creating your AI influencer. Follow along, take your time, and remember - simplicity and authenticity are key. You’ve got this!</p>",
