      "duration_minutes": null,
      "is_published": true,
      "action_task": null,
      "notes": "<h2>🔴 WHAT: CREATING VIDEOS WITH HEYGEN</h2><p>In this lesson, you'll learn how to effectively use <strong>HeyGen</strong>, a powerful tool for creating engaging, avatar-based videos. HeyGen simplifies video creation by offering features that are perfect for social media-style content, particularly <strong>selfie talking videos</strong>, which are currently very popular.</p><p>With HeyGen, you can streamline your video production process and create professional content that attracts views and drives sales.</p><hr><h2>🟠 WHY: THE BENEFIT OF HEYGEN</h2><p>HeyGen offers a seamless way to produce high-quality videos with longer durations, making it ideal for content that requires more time to deliver its message. Compared to other tools like Cling Motion Control, which is great for attention-grabbing hooks, HeyGen excels at producing the bulk of your video content with a professional and personal touch.</p><p>By leveraging avatars and voice-changer technology, you can produce videos that feel authentic and relatable while spending less time on manual editing and recording.</p><hr><h2>🟢 HOW: GETTING STARTED WITH HEYGEN</h2><h3>STEP 1: CREATE YOUR <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-[#C9A44C] underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#C9A44C]/80\" href=\"https://www.heygen.com/?sid=rewardful&amp;utm_content=creator&amp;utm_medium=affiliate&amp;via=gregory-cooke\">HEYGEN</a> ACCOUNT</h3><p>The first step is to set up your <strong>HeyGen account</strong>. Visit the HeyGen platform and go through the sign-up process to create your account.</p><h3>STEP 2: UPLOAD YOUR AVATAR AND SETTINGS</h3><p>After creating your account, upload your avatar and configure all the necessary <strong>settings</strong>. This includes customizing the appearance and voice settings for your avatar. Make sure everything is ready to move to the next phase smoothly.</p><h3>STEP 3: TEST YOUR FIRST VIDEO</h3><p>Start by creating a simple, short video with your avatar to get familiar with the process. Here's how you can do it:</p><ul><li><p>Record your own voice or use the <strong>voice changer</strong> feature available in HeyGen.</p></li><li><p>If you prefer, you can use a pre-selected voice, but you'll need to connect your HeyGen account to your <strong>11 Labs account</strong> via the API for this functionality.</p></li><li><p>Download your completed video and review it to ensure your avatar and audio work seamlessly together.</p></li></ul><h3>STEP 4: SCALE WITH CONTENT THAT GETS RESULTS</h3><p>Once you've created your first video and tested the process, you're ready to move into full production. Use HeyGen to start creating content designed to get <strong>views</strong> and <strong>sales</strong>, ultimately helping you make money with compelling AI-powered videos.</p><blockquote><p>💡 Tip: Combine HeyGen with hooks from tools like Kling Motion Control for a killer content strategy that grabs attention and keeps your viewers engaged.</p><p></p></blockquote><p></p>",
