      "notes": "<h2>INTRO</h2>\n\n<p>Welcome to this phase of the course! In this lesson, we’re diving into how you can use <strong>ads</strong> to increase your sales, scale your account faster, and gain more views on your content. I’ll walk you through several approaches, including different campaign types you can choose based on how quickly or aggressively you want to scale.</p>\n\n<p>If the word “ad” makes you uneasy because of the potential cost, don’t worry - you’re not alone. Ads, when done correctly, should <strong>never</strong> feel like an expense. Instead, think of them as a strategic <strong>investment</strong> in your growth.</p>\n\n<blockquote>💡 <strong>Important takeaway:</strong> Ads should never cost you money; they should always make back the money you invest (and more).</blockquote>\n\n<p>In the next lesson, we’ll dive deeper into the mindset needed for effective ad use. I'll help you reframe how you think about ads so you can approach them confidently, knowing they’re a tool for growth instead of an expense.</p> \n\n<hr>",
